<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj/concepts/100018> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "Flintlock"@en ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj/concepts/95204> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Flintlock Pistol"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A pistol fired by use of a flintlock.A gunflint is held in the lock which on pulling the trigger pushes back the pan cover creating sparks which set off the powder in the pan causing a flame to go through and set off the charge in the barrel."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj/concepts/100019> a skos:Concept ;
