    skos:scopeNote "A coin struck, cast or stamped imitating an official coinage issue of contemporary or slightly later time period. The piece may consist of a similar alloy or a base core with plating of varying thickness."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj/concepts/139086> a skos:Concept ;
