    skos:scopeNote "A jar adapted by the addition of three or more vertical loop handles. They may be equally spaced, or confined to one section of the circumference. Profile vary and should be double indexed with the appropriate JAR type. (Source: MPRG)"@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/mda_obj/concepts/148341> a skos:Concept ;
